{{!--
  A section of the content-block item sheet (item-content-block-sheet.hbs): its
  heading above the block content. Rendered only when `show` is true, so a
  read-only sheet hides a section with nothing in it rather than printing its
  heading over nothing (#597); edit mode always shows it, to be filled in.

  Hash arguments:
    icon     — Font Awesome icon class of the heading (e.g. "fa-book"). Required.
    labelKey — i18n key of the heading text. Required.
    show     — whether to render the section. Required.

  The section carries `data-content-section="<labelKey>"`, so tests find it by its heading.

  Usage:
    {{#> systems/wh40k-rpg/templates/item/partial/content-block-section.hbs icon="fa-book" labelKey="…" show=(or inEditMode (hasText value))}}
        … the section's content …
    {{/systems/wh40k-rpg/templates/item/partial/content-block-section.hbs}}
--}}
{{#if show}}
<div class="tw-mb-3" data-content-section="{{labelKey}}">
  {{> systems/wh40k-rpg/templates/item/partial/content-block-heading.hbs icon=icon labelKey=labelKey}}
  <div class="tw-px-1">
    {{> @partial-block}}
  </div>
</div>
{{/if}}
